# Keep the build context small and secret-free (docs/devagotchi/38-ci-containers.md).
**/node_modules
**/.git
.run
dist
test-evidence
tests
docs
server/bin
web/dist
# The image builds the UI fresh; the committed embed copy must not leak stale hashed assets into it.
server/internal/httpapi/static
**/*.log
**/*.token
**/*.key
